    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="97540ac8-e21a-5990-8ea5-f0d2923eebda" activityNameId="073243c6-3fa3-51ff-b2cb-3511f11c69b4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation system, Schulhaus Heslibach, various components</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilation system, Schulhaus Heslibach, various components
Disposal of various components for a ventilation system for a school with schoolrooms and recreation room. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 2849 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 13630 m3/h, total weight of the components: 2843 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 4.8 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for air valves, air intake, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers and sensors.;
UUID: 94bf3ef8-9a72-4745-bd82-f94efa8b2538
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_94bf3ef8-9a72-4745-bd82-f94efa8b2538.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
